'16. Act to override other laws.- The provisions of this Act shall have effectnotwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in any other law for the time being inforce.17. Removal of difficulty.- (1) lf any difficulty arises in giving effect tothe provisions of this Act, the Federal Government may, by notification in the officialGazette, remove such difficulty as is not inconsistent with the provisions of this Act.18. Revision of declaration'- Any person who, having filed a declaration,hereinafter referred to as the "original declaration", discovers any omission, mistake,computational error or wrong statement therein, may file revised declaration within thedue date specified in section 3, subject to the condition that the value of asset or taxthereon shall be not less than the value of asset and tax thereon, declared in theoriginal declaration.19. Repeal.- The Assets Declaration Ordinance, 2019 (lll of 20'19) is herebyrepealed from the date of commencement of this Act.THE SCHEDULEfsee section 4]Rates of Tax(1) The rates of tax imposed on undisclosed assets, sales andexpenditures shatl be as specifled in the following Table, namely: -TABLE
